---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../components/layout/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/layout/Footer.astro';
---
<Base title="Projects" description="Everything built at matterunknown: identity research experiments, and real tools made for the joy of it.">
<style>
  .head { padding: 56px 0 4px; max-width: 46rem; }
  .head p { color: var(--text-2); font-size: 1.05rem; margin-top: 8px; }
  .shelf { margin-top: 56px; max-width: 46rem; font-size: .9rem; color: var(--text-3); }
  .shelf a { color: var(--teal); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
</style>

<Nav variant="full" active="/projects" />

<main class="wrapb">
  <div class="head">
    <h1 class="statement">Projects</h1>
    <p>Two kinds of work. The research experiments exist to make identity failures visible; the rest exists because building it was fun. Everything shown is real and running unless it says otherwise.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="sect" style="margin-top:44px">
    <div class="sect-head"><h2>Research</h2><a href="/model">The framework →</a></div>
    <div class="grid3">
      <a class="icard" href="/projects/identity-map">
        <img src="/images/projects/identity-map.png" alt="Identity Surface Map" loading="lazy" width="1280" height="750" />
        <div class="icard-body"><span class="icard-kicker">Interactive · Live</span><h3>Identity Surface Map</h3><p>An interactive map of every system holding a version of you.</p></div>
      </a>
      <a class="icard" href="/projects/password-graveyard">
        <img src="/images/projects/password-graveyard.png" alt="The Password Graveyard" loading="lazy" width="1280" height="750" />
        <div class="icard-body"><span class="icard-kicker">Interactive · Live</span><h3>The Password Graveyard</h3><p>Enter a password, learn when it died and what killed it.</p></div>
      </a>
      <a class="icard" href="/projects/digital-shadow">
        <img src="/images/projects/digital-shadow.png" alt="Your Digital Shadow" loading="lazy" width="1280" height="750" />
        <div class="icard-body"><span class="icard-kicker">Interactive · Live</span><h3>Your Digital Shadow</h3><p>What data brokers and ad networks probably know about you.</p></div>
      </a>
      <a class="icard" href="/projects/osint-dashboard">
        <div class="icard-body"><span class="icard-kicker">Reference · Live</span><h3>OSINT Dashboard</h3><p>Identity-research tools, organized by workflow instead of alphabet.</p></div>
      </a>
      <span class="icard">
        <div class="icard-body"><span class="icard-kicker">Standards · In progress</span><h3>agentic-id</h3><p>Intent tokens for AI agents, built on RFC 8693 and SPIFFE. Will be open source, with a paper.</p></div>
      </span>
      <a class="icard" href="/model">
        <div class="icard-body"><span class="icard-kicker">Framework</span><h3>The Identity Model</h3><p>Three identity layers, four failure modes — the lab's operating framework.</p></div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="sect">
    <div class="sect-head"><h2>For the joy of it</h2></div>
    <div class="grid3">
      <a class="icard" href="https://commonlist.matterunknown.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <img src="https://commonlist.matterunknown.com/og.png" alt="Commonlist" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="630" />
        <div class="icard-body"><span class="icard-kicker">App · Live</span><h3>Commonlist</h3><p>One clean address book: connect, clean, and merge contacts across Google, Microsoft, Outlook, and iCloud.</p></div>
      </a>
      <a class="icard" href="/projects/quant-trading">
        <img src="/images/projects/quant-trading.png" alt="Quant scanner positions and trade log" loading="lazy" width="1280" height="750" />
        <div class="icard-body"><span class="icard-kicker">Finance · Paper trading</span><h3>Quant scanner</h3><p>100 symbols scanned nightly, defensive rotation thesis, every trade public.</p></div>
      </a>
      <a class="icard" href="/projects/pokemon-model">
        <img src="/images/projects/pokemon-model.png" alt="Pokémon model dashboard" loading="lazy" width="1280" height="750" />
        <div class="icard-body"><span class="icard-kicker">Collecting · Live</span><h3>Pokémon model</h3><p>17,000+ cards scored daily for mispriced scarcity.</p></div>
      </a>
      <a class="icard" href="/projects/crypto-model">
        <img src="/images/projects/crypto-model.png" alt="Crypto model signals" loading="lazy" width="1280" height="750" />
        <div class="icard-body"><span class="icard-kicker">Finance · Live</span><h3>Crypto model</h3><p>21 assets scored daily on price signals, market structure, and quality.</p></div>
      </a>
      <a class="icard" href="/projects/onepiece-model">
        <div class="icard-body"><span class="icard-kicker">Collecting · Live</span><h3>One Piece model</h3><p>The same scoring model, applied to a market with no serious tooling.</p></div>
      </a>
      <a class="icard" href="/projects/gpk-model">
        <div class="icard-body"><span class="icard-kicker">Collecting · Live</span><h3>Garbage Pail Kids model</h3><p>Forty years of a novelty card market, treated like an asset class.</p></div>
      </a>
      <a class="icard" href="/projects/mtg-decks">
        <div class="icard-body"><span class="icard-kicker">Collecting</span><h3>MTG decks</h3><p>Emrakul Commander and Death &amp; Taxes Legacy, built as appreciating assets.</p></div>
      </a>
      <a class="icard" href="/studio/broken-heart-ohio">
        <div class="icard-body"><span class="icard-kicker">Client build · Live</span><h3>Broken Heart Ohio</h3><p>A tattoo studio's website, booking, and payments, built from scratch.</p></div>
      </a>
      <span class="icard">
        <div class="icard-body"><span class="icard-kicker">Roblox · Building</span><h3>Harvest Haven</h3><p>A farming game built with my 10 year old.</p></div>
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="shelf">Shelved: Ghost Signal, a five-book espionage series (two books written), waits for the research to have traction. The Vessel experiment is <a href="/archive/vessel">preserved in the archive</a>.</p>
</main>

<Footer />
</Base>
